  "description": "PDMR-833975-119-R is a dataset of detailed MRI, PET/CT (FDG and FLT) in patient-derived xenograft in mouse model of pancreatic adenocarcinoma from the National Cancer Institute Patient-Derived Models Repository with baseline and bi-weekly monitoring imaging. Please see the PDMR-833975-119-R wiki page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
